Now need to ensure that we used correct syntax for LINT#50 and LINT#16#7FFFFFFFFFFFFFFF. In IEC ST, you can write LINT#50. For max LINT, you can use LINT#16#7FFFFFFFFFFFFFFF (hex). Or you can use LINT#9223372036854775807. Both okay.

