   // Condition: prevLeadPump = 0 (i.e., no lead pump selected yet). This includes the case where demand was zero previously (leadPump=0). So we can detect initial selection as (prevLeadPump = 0). But need to also consider that after a zero demand, we set leadPump=0, lagPump=0. So prevLeadPump after that will be 0, correct.

